(52, 4, 28, 11, 1, 10, 2, 2, 4, 13, NULL, 1, 7, 2, '13th month salary + performance bonus, premium health insurance for employee + family.', 'Own the data pipeline from ingestion to visualisation, ensuring data quality. Participate in code reviews, sprint planning, retrospectives and on-call rotations. Drive the delivery of structured analytics dashboards for business stakeholders. Pair with senior engineers to design new modules and refactor legacy areas.', 'Track record of shipping production-quality software in collaborative teams. Familiarity with REST APIs, version control (Git), and CI/CD pipelines. Solid understanding of OOP, algorithms, and modern web architecture. Experience working in an Agile / Scrum delivery team.', 'Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP or Azure). Exposure to data warehousing tools (BigQuery, Snowflake, Redshift).', 'You will join a 6-person squad reporting to the Engineering Manager.', 2, 4, 'active', '2026-04-13 15:00:00'),
